    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Null Maiden Vigil",
    "summary": "This Detachment changes your army as follows:\n\n- as you [muster your army](vsdata:core-rule/muster-armies), you can pick an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA CHARACTER** model of yours as your **WARLORD**\n- your **PROSECUTOR SQUAD** units get the **BATTLELINE** keyword\n- your **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** units get this ability:\n\n**Creeping Dread (Aura)**: during [your opponent's Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), at its [Battle-shock step](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock-step), every enemy unit up to 12\" from this unit that is either a **PSYKER** unit or under its **Starting Strength** takes a [Battle-shock roll](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) at -1.",
